TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Yine karşılaştık!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} Bugün
birbirimizi her köşede
buluyoruz. Fena değil.{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:000A:0001:09000A00}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Looks like you're serious about
fishing today, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}You're a real pro, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sembra che tu sia prontissim{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
per andare a pesca, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Metticela tutta, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ci vediamo spesso oggi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Per me va benissimo, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Hai stile da vendere!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm seeing you everywhere I go
today, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Lucky me!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Your fashions are always fantastic.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Esa {{TAG:0005:0008:}}! Hoy tengo
la suerte de verte muy a menudo
y disfrutar de tu estilo único.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ovunque io vada ti incontro,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Che fortunello!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Mi piace come ti vesti!
